WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:03.968
-As they start to worry
about their midterm prospects,

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.767
Republicans are turning
to their favorite election-year

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:07.834
scare tactic by lying
about immigration,

00:00:07.834 --> 00:00:10.901
highlighted by an especially
cruel and sadistic stunt

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:12.367
from Florida Governor
Ron DeSantis,

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:14.067
who claimed credit
for his scheme

00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:16.033
to lie to a group
of undocumented migrants

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:18.868
and lure them onto a plane
that then dropped them off

00:00:18.868 --> 00:00:20.834
on a remote island
where they didn't know anyone.

00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:23.234
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:23.234 --> 00:00:27.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:27.167 --> 00:00:28.934
An ironclad rule of modern

00:00:28.934 --> 00:00:30.868
Republican politics
in the Trump era

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:32.701
is that in order to thrive
within the party,

00:00:32.701 --> 00:00:35.467
you must have an unquenchable
thirst for embarrassment.

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:37.601
You have to be
a glutton for shame.

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:39.601
You have to be willing
to debase yourself

00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:41.934
and endure any indignity
or humiliation

00:00:41.934 --> 00:00:43.467
thrown your way
by Donald Trump.

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:46.267
That's the one thing his
cult-like inner circle

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:48.400
of criminal mutant gargoyles
all have in common.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.767
There's just no amount
of [bleep] they won't eat

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:54.434
just to get invited to Trump's
haunted golf mansion

00:00:54.434 --> 00:00:56.934
for the honor
of a photo op

00:00:56.934 --> 00:01:00.067
with a man whose thumbs-up
looks so unnatural,

00:01:00.067 --> 00:01:02.167
you wouldn't be surprised
if they had to lift it

00:01:02.167 --> 00:01:05.434
into position using an elaborate
system of pulleys and levers.

00:01:05.434 --> 00:01:08.534
"Is it time for the picture?
Let's get cranking, Eric!"

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:10.567
"Yes, father, yes!"

00:01:10.567 --> 00:01:13.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.934 --> 00:01:16.234
"Faster, Eric.
I don't have all day."

00:01:16.234 --> 00:01:17.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.767 --> 00:01:19.868
"We're losing the light, Eric!"

00:01:19.868 --> 00:01:21.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:24.267
Ted Cruz threw his own family
under the bus for Trump.

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:26.434
Matt Gaetz reportedly asked him
for a pardon

00:01:26.434 --> 00:01:27.701
in a sex-trafficking case.

00:01:27.701 --> 00:01:29.767
And Rudy Giuliani
did a press conference

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:31.100
outside a landscaping company

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:32.901
near a crematorium
and a sex shop.

00:01:32.901 --> 00:01:34.968
And you should have
seen his face

00:01:34.968 --> 00:01:37.667
when he accidentally
walked into the sex shop.

00:01:37.667 --> 00:01:40.667
"Whoa! These are some very
odd-looking microphones."

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:45.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.767 --> 00:01:48.467
Now, of course, we could've
Photoshopped this Rudy picture

00:01:48.467 --> 00:01:52.100
screaming
into a dildo microphone,

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:57.100
but it wasn't fair,
so we didn't do it.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:01.667
I mean, you can picture
what it would've looked like,

00:02:01.667 --> 00:02:03.267
but that's on you.

00:02:03.267 --> 00:02:05.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.067 --> 00:02:07.267
We didn't do it.

00:02:07.267 --> 00:02:10.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.534 --> 00:02:13.734
And now the most vivid example
of humiliating obsequiousness

00:02:13.734 --> 00:02:15.868
to Trump is Ohio
Senate candidate J.D. Vance,

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:17.701
a Yale Law School graduate

00:02:17.701 --> 00:02:20.000
and Silicon Valley
venture capitalist.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.067
Vance was once
a relentless critic of Trump.

00:02:22.067 --> 00:02:23.567
He called himself
a "Never Trump guy"

00:02:23.567 --> 00:02:25.667
who said he couldn't stomach
Trump, called Trump noxious

00:02:25.667 --> 00:02:28.100
and an idiot, even suggested
Trump could be America's Hitler.

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.501
Hell, Vance could've been
one of my writers.

00:02:30.501 --> 00:02:33.734
In fact, he even
came on this show

00:02:33.734 --> 00:02:35.901
and talked to me,
a cosmopolitan,

00:02:35.901 --> 00:02:38.467
coastal elite, no less,
when he was hawking his book.

00:02:38.467 --> 00:02:40.467
And no one who has
nice things to say

00:02:40.467 --> 00:02:41.767
about Donald Trump
comes on this show.

00:02:41.767 --> 00:02:43.601
I mean,
except for that one time

00:02:43.601 --> 00:02:45.434
we did day drinking
with Mike Lindell.

00:02:45.434 --> 00:02:46.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.901 --> 00:02:48.901
You know, it's funny,
because his normal voice

00:02:48.901 --> 00:02:50.133
is drunk guy at a bar

00:02:50.133 --> 00:02:51.434
telling you how much
he loves you,

00:02:51.434 --> 00:02:53.067
but his drunk voice --
it's so weird --

00:02:53.067 --> 00:02:55.467
is British gentlemen.

00:02:55.467 --> 00:02:57.133
"I have proof that
Hugo Chavez

00:02:57.133 --> 00:02:58.667
hacked the Dominion
voting machines.

00:02:58.667 --> 00:03:00.868
Now let's do some shots
and head over

00:03:00.868 --> 00:03:02.501
to Makato Hardee's.

00:03:02.501 --> 00:03:04.033
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.033 --> 00:03:06.234
But now Vance has cynically
retracted everything he said

00:03:06.234 --> 00:03:08.467
about Trump to run for Senate.
And Trump has repaid

00:03:08.467 --> 00:03:11.100
Vance's newfound loyalty
by both endorsing him

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:13.167
and also repeatedly
humiliating him.

00:03:13.167 --> 00:03:14.634
At a rally a few months ago,

00:03:14.634 --> 00:03:17.601
Trump forgot Vance's name
and then confused him

00:03:17.601 --> 00:03:19.534
with one of Vance's
primary opponents,

00:03:19.534 --> 00:03:22.901
first calling him
J.P. and then J.D. Mandel.

00:03:22.901 --> 00:03:25.701
And then over the weekend,
Trump appeared at another rally

00:03:25.701 --> 00:03:28.367
with Vance and again
took the opportunity to make

00:03:28.367 --> 00:03:30.534
Vance eat [bleep]
for his own entertainment.

00:03:30.534 --> 00:03:32.667
"The New York Times"
did a fake story today --

00:03:32.667 --> 00:03:34.434
big front page --
that J.D. wasn't sure

00:03:34.434 --> 00:03:35.767
if he wanted my support.

00:03:35.767 --> 00:03:38.901
J.D. is kissing my ass
he wants my support so --

00:03:38.901 --> 00:03:40.834
Yeah, he said
some bad things about me,

00:03:40.834 --> 00:03:43.567
but that was before he knew me,
and then he fell in love.

00:03:43.567 --> 00:03:45.400
"J.D. is a great guy.
Great guy.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.667
Used to hate my guts,

00:03:46.667 --> 00:03:48.400
but then he realized
he couldn't win without me.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:52.501
So he changed his tune in order
to court my voters,

00:03:52.501 --> 00:03:54.067
who he sees as gullible rubes.

00:03:54.067 --> 00:03:55.367
That's you.
You're the rubes."

00:03:55.367 --> 00:03:56.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.968 --> 00:03:58.968
And it's not just Trump
they've devoted themselves to

00:03:58.968 --> 00:04:01.000
but Trumpism.
For example, when Vance

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.200
took the podium
at this rally on Saturday

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:05.167
and began to list
the various problems

00:04:05.167 --> 00:04:07.934
he would address
as a senator from Ohio,

00:04:07.934 --> 00:04:10.033
the first thing
he could apparently think of

00:04:10.033 --> 00:04:12.934
was actually 1,500 miles away
from where he was speaking.

00:04:12.934 --> 00:04:15.234
-We have got some problems
right now, ladies and gentlemen.

00:04:15.234 --> 00:04:17.534
We've got some problems
on the southern border.

00:04:17.534 --> 00:04:19.601
-The southern border of Ohio?

00:04:19.601 --> 00:04:21.334
[ Laughter ]

00:04:21.334 --> 00:04:23.133
You guys have a lot of problem
with refugees

00:04:23.133 --> 00:04:25.534
from Kentucky streaming
across your border?

00:04:25.534 --> 00:04:27.734
"You don't understand.
That place is dystopian.

00:04:27.734 --> 00:04:30.200
Hell, we live under the thumb
of a ruthless dictator.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.801
He calls himself the Colonel."

00:04:31.801 --> 00:04:33.734
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.734 --> 00:04:36.300
No one's number-one problem
is that far away,

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:38.534
unless they're being catfished
as part of a fake

00:04:38.534 --> 00:04:39.934
long-distance relationship.

00:04:39.934 --> 00:04:41.968
"Yeah, I met this girl, Jessica,
who lives in Vancouver.

00:04:41.968 --> 00:04:44.234
She's so great.
But, you know, it has --

00:04:44.234 --> 00:04:45.801
It has been a drain financially.

00:04:45.801 --> 00:04:48.267
I've been sending her money
for a surgery to have her

00:04:48.267 --> 00:04:49.767
Getty watermark removed."

00:04:49.767 --> 00:04:53.434
[ Laughter ]

00:04:53.434 --> 00:04:56.801
It's one thing to say we should
fix the immigration system,

00:04:56.801 --> 00:04:58.300
but Republicans are singularly

00:04:58.300 --> 00:04:59.868
and obsessively
focused on the border.

00:04:59.868 --> 00:05:02.234
For example,
there's this anecdote from 2018

00:05:02.234 --> 00:05:04.400
that I'll never forget,
when Trump was obsessively

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.067
hyping up the so-called caravans

00:05:06.067 --> 00:05:07.934
of migrants supposedly headed
for the border.

00:05:07.934 --> 00:05:09.501
And "The New York Times"
reported that

00:05:09.501 --> 00:05:12.133
"Trump's dystopian imagery
has clearly left an impression,

00:05:12.133 --> 00:05:14.000
with some, including
a 75-year-old Republican

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.067
in northern Minnesota,
who said she was afraid

00:05:16.067 --> 00:05:18.734
that migrant gangs could take
over people's summer lake homes

00:05:18.734 --> 00:05:20.567
in the state.
'What's to stop them?

00:05:20.567 --> 00:05:22.467
We have a lot of people
who live on lakes in the summer

00:05:22.467 --> 00:05:23.767
and winter someplace else.

00:05:23.767 --> 00:05:25.234
When they come back
in the spring,

00:05:25.234 --> 00:05:26.868
their house would be occupied.'"

00:05:26.868 --> 00:05:28.567
Yeah.
I mean, what is to stop them?

00:05:28.567 --> 00:05:31.200
They could just waltz right
over the border into El Paso,

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:33.601
hop on a Greyhound bus,
ride that for three days,

00:05:33.601 --> 00:05:35.801
break into a cabin
on a frozen lake

00:05:35.801 --> 00:05:38.767
in northern Minnesota,
and catch Viking fever.

00:05:38.767 --> 00:05:39.901
[ Laughter ]

00:05:39.901 --> 00:05:41.300
I'll say if you live
in Minnesota

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:42.901
and leave your house
unoccupied for the winter,

00:05:42.901 --> 00:05:44.434
you're much more likely
to come back

00:05:44.434 --> 00:05:45.734
and find Mike Lindell
living there.

00:05:45.734 --> 00:05:47.534
I mean...
[ Laughter ]

00:05:47.534 --> 00:05:49.434
...he needs a place
to hibernate for the winter,

00:05:49.434 --> 00:05:51.534
just like, you know, da bears.
But that's...

00:05:51.534 --> 00:05:53.467
[ Laughter ]

00:05:53.467 --> 00:05:56.834
...how you know things are
not going well for the GOP

00:05:56.834 --> 00:05:58.767
when they bust out the caravans

00:05:58.767 --> 00:06:00.501
and start hyperventilating
about the border.

00:06:00.501 --> 00:06:03.834
That's a sure sign of their
political fortunes in any poll.

00:06:03.834 --> 00:06:06.367
That's what Trump did in 2018.
Didn't work.

00:06:06.367 --> 00:06:08.534
But now they're doubling down
and trying it again.

00:06:08.534 --> 00:06:10.167
In fact,
at that very same rally,

00:06:10.167 --> 00:06:11.767
Trump actually took credit

00:06:11.767 --> 00:06:14.367
for inventing the word
"caravan."

00:06:14.367 --> 00:06:15.667
-What's the problem?
I said,

00:06:15.667 --> 00:06:17.901
"Well, you won't take
these horrible convicts

00:06:17.901 --> 00:06:19.334
and other people
that you released

00:06:19.334 --> 00:06:23.067
into our country illegally,
and you put them in caravans."

00:06:23.067 --> 00:06:24.467
I came up with that term,
by the way.

00:06:24.467 --> 00:06:26.067
That was my term,
like "fake news"

00:06:26.067 --> 00:06:28.734
and lots of other terms
we came up with.

00:06:28.734 --> 00:06:29.801
"Crooked Hillary."

00:06:29.801 --> 00:06:31.033
We came up
with "Crooked Hillary."

00:06:31.033 --> 00:06:33.267
We came up with a lot of...

00:06:33.267 --> 00:06:36.234
He's like Billy Joel, stopping
in the middle of an MSG set

00:06:36.234 --> 00:06:38.200
and saying, "You know,
I came up with Piano Man.

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:41.267
Yeah, before me,
people had to say penis,

00:06:41.267 --> 00:06:43.467
but nobody liked it 'cause
it reminded them of ding dongs.

00:06:43.467 --> 00:06:45.501
Also, Italian restaurant.
That was one of mine.

00:06:45.501 --> 00:06:46.801
Before, it was ristorante.

00:06:46.801 --> 00:06:48.334
What do you guys want next?

00:06:48.334 --> 00:06:49.534
What do you guys
want to hear next?

00:06:49.534 --> 00:06:52.567
"Big Shot"? I don't care.
I get paid either way.

00:06:52.567 --> 00:06:53.834
The problem for Trump
and his gang

00:06:53.834 --> 00:06:56.133
is that they've already
tried this and failed.

00:06:56.133 --> 00:06:58.133
Everyone is onto them,
which is now

00:06:58.133 --> 00:07:00.267
why they're trying
to out-MAGA themselves

00:07:00.267 --> 00:07:01.567
with increasingly ghoulish

00:07:01.567 --> 00:07:03.067
and despicable acts
of cruelty

00:07:03.067 --> 00:07:04.934
toward migrants fleeing
poverty and violence.

00:07:04.934 --> 00:07:07.501
Which brings us to Florida
Governor Ron DeSantis --

00:07:07.501 --> 00:07:09.601
you know,
grown-up Nelson Muntz --

00:07:09.601 --> 00:07:11.534
and his grotesque scheme

00:07:11.534 --> 00:07:15.200
to apparently lure migrants
from Texas onto a plane

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.968
so he could drop them off
on Martha's Vineyard

00:07:16.968 --> 00:07:18.734
without telling them
or anyone else,

00:07:18.734 --> 00:07:22.300
a stunt designed entirely
to curry favor with Fox News,

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:24.267
who he apparently
alerted beforehand.

00:07:24.267 --> 00:07:25.601
You see, they thought
the people who live

00:07:25.601 --> 00:07:27.100
on Martha's Vineyard
would freak out.

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:29.634
Instead, residents
and community organizations

00:07:29.634 --> 00:07:30.934
scrambled without any notice

00:07:30.934 --> 00:07:33.167
to provide aid and comfort
to the migrants.

00:07:33.167 --> 00:07:35.434
-Tonight, the community
of Martha's Vineyard

00:07:35.434 --> 00:07:38.100
coming together to provide
food and shelter

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:42.067
to 48 undocumented migrants,
women, men, and children

00:07:42.067 --> 00:07:44.667
who landed on
the wealthy island Wednesday.

00:07:44.667 --> 00:07:47.133
So this entire thing
was funded by Florida.

00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:49.434
The flights were part
of the state's program

00:07:49.434 --> 00:07:51.534
to transport undocumented
migrants

00:07:51.534 --> 00:07:53.834
to so-called sanctuary cities.

00:07:53.834 --> 00:07:55.701
Now, earlier this year,
Florida lawmakers,

00:07:55.701 --> 00:07:59.267
they had set aside $12 million
for this transport program.

00:07:59.267 --> 00:08:00.767
Looks like they're
starting to use it.

00:08:00.767 --> 00:08:04.033
-And the $12 million, I guess,
is coming from the federal money

00:08:04.033 --> 00:08:05.667
that came in for coronavirus.

00:08:05.667 --> 00:08:06.801
-So congrats, Florida.

00:08:06.801 --> 00:08:08.167
You just spent a bunch
of taxpayer money

00:08:08.167 --> 00:08:10.200
on a stupid and repulsive stunt
that achieved nothing

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:12.267
except maybe some publicity
for Ron DeSantis's

00:08:12.267 --> 00:08:14.133
2024 presidential bid.

00:08:14.133 --> 00:08:16.467
And worse than that,
you gave the rich liberals

00:08:16.467 --> 00:08:17.834
who summer on Martha's Vineyard,

00:08:17.834 --> 00:08:19.767
another thing to feel
self-righteous about.

00:08:19.767 --> 00:08:21.000
[ Laughter ]

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.801
"When I heard those
poor migrants had arrived,

00:08:22.801 --> 00:08:24.133
I put on my Birkenstocks

00:08:24.133 --> 00:08:26.167
and loaded my Tesla
with sandwiches and pitched in.

00:08:26.167 --> 00:08:29.901
I'm not saying I'm better
than you, I'm proving it."

00:08:29.901 --> 00:08:31.567
[ Laughter ]

00:08:31.567 --> 00:08:35.868
Also, not to let you too inside
on how summer vacations work,

00:08:35.868 --> 00:08:38.067
but most of the liberals
you hate left the vineyard

00:08:38.067 --> 00:08:40.067
two weeks ago.
And I should know.

00:08:40.067 --> 00:08:42.300
I'm one of them.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:44.200
That's right.
I go to the Vineyard.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:46.033
And you know where I was
during President Obama's

00:08:46.033 --> 00:08:48.701
star-studded Martha's Vineyard
birthday party last summer?

00:08:48.701 --> 00:08:51.234
Having dinner with my in-laws
'cause I wasn't invited.

00:08:51.234 --> 00:08:52.501
[ Laughter ]

00:08:52.501 --> 00:08:55.968
And not for lack of trying,
it should be noted.

00:08:55.968 --> 00:08:57.734
But it's also important
to make a distinction

00:08:57.734 --> 00:08:59.767
between the people who spend
their summers on the island

00:08:59.767 --> 00:09:01.334
and people who live
there year round,

00:09:01.334 --> 00:09:02.501
like the hardworking staff

00:09:02.501 --> 00:09:04.067
at Martha's Vineyard
Community Services

00:09:04.067 --> 00:09:06.300
who rose to the occasion
with grace and empathy.

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:09.434
Personally, I feel like DeSantis
could've put the money he spent

00:09:09.434 --> 00:09:11.100
on this stunt
to better use in Florida

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:13.801
like their local community
service organizations.

00:09:13.801 --> 00:09:15.067
Or, I don't know,
more traffic cops

00:09:15.067 --> 00:09:17.334
to chase down seniors
doing 80 on the highway

00:09:17.334 --> 00:09:19.801
in their golf carts.
Have you ever been down there?

00:09:19.801 --> 00:09:21.133
Those people drive their
golf carts

00:09:21.133 --> 00:09:22.334
like they're [bleep] Maseratis.

00:09:22.334 --> 00:09:24.734
One time,
I pulled up to a light,

00:09:24.734 --> 00:09:26.734
and an 85-year-old grandpa
in golf khakis

00:09:26.734 --> 00:09:29.567
challenged me
to a street race.

00:09:29.567 --> 00:09:32.300
Even their attempts to dunk on
Massachusetts residents failed.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:33.968
Like when Ted Cruz
tweeted the quote,

00:09:33.968 --> 00:09:36.200
Dems had activated
the National Guard

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:38.300
to interdict migrants
in Massachusetts

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:39.501
before it was pointed out to him

00:09:39.501 --> 00:09:40.868
that the governor
of Massachusetts

00:09:40.868 --> 00:09:43.033
is a Republican
named Charlie Baker,

00:09:43.033 --> 00:09:45.501
who called up the guard
to provide temporary shelter

00:09:45.501 --> 00:09:47.834
and humanitarian resources
to the migrants

00:09:47.834 --> 00:09:49.133
on Joint Base Cape Cod.

00:09:49.133 --> 00:09:50.501
It was such
an embarrassing mistake,

00:09:50.501 --> 00:09:51.801
Cruz had to delete the tweet.

00:09:51.801 --> 00:09:54.567
And then, to make sure
the tweet was fully deleted,

00:09:54.567 --> 00:09:56.501
he said he had to find
the server

00:09:56.501 --> 00:09:58.968
where all the tweets are stored
and go there in person

00:09:58.968 --> 00:10:01.501
to physically remove the disk
from the hard drive,

00:10:01.501 --> 00:10:04.067
a hard drive he claimed
was in Cancun.

00:10:04.067 --> 00:10:06.200
I don't know.
[ Laughter ]

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:08.901
Seems weird to me, but...

00:10:08.901 --> 00:10:10.601
I mean, he's a senator.
You got to trust him.

00:10:10.601 --> 00:10:12.667
Now, on top of the many ways

00:10:12.667 --> 00:10:14.334
in which this stunt
was ghoulish and cruel,

00:10:14.334 --> 00:10:16.234
NPR reported that the migrants
were also

00:10:16.234 --> 00:10:19.067
apparently lured onto the plane
under false pretenses

00:10:19.067 --> 00:10:20.634
and told they were
headed to Boston,

00:10:20.634 --> 00:10:22.434
where they would get
expedited work papers.

00:10:22.434 --> 00:10:25.200
Not to mention the fact that
when they were dropped off

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:28.033
on a remote island far away
from their court appointments

00:10:28.033 --> 00:10:31.000
where they don't know anyone,
in an especially cruel twist,

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:32.934
they were intentionally
given only the most

00:10:32.934 --> 00:10:35.033
rudimentary information
about where they were headed.

00:10:35.033 --> 00:10:37.667
-Accounts from the migrants
who arrived last night

00:10:37.667 --> 00:10:41.901
make it clear that they were
lied to again and again

00:10:41.901 --> 00:10:45.334
and fraudulently induced
to board the planes.

00:10:45.334 --> 00:10:48.934
They were told there was
a surprise present for them

00:10:48.934 --> 00:10:50.300
and that there would be jobs

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:53.801
and housing awaiting for them
when they arrived.

00:10:53.801 --> 00:10:56.400
This was obviously
a sadistic lie.

00:10:56.400 --> 00:11:00.968
They also very intentionally
chose not to call ahead

00:11:00.968 --> 00:11:04.200
to any single office
authority on Martha's Vineyard

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:07.267
so that even the most basic
human-needs arrangements

00:11:07.267 --> 00:11:08.701
could be made.

00:11:08.701 --> 00:11:13.100
Ensuring that no help
awaited the migrants at all

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:15.701
was the entire point.

00:11:15.701 --> 00:11:18.534
They were provided with
a cartoonishly simple map

00:11:18.534 --> 00:11:21.367
of Martha's Vineyard
and the United States.

00:11:21.367 --> 00:11:25.033
-I dare you to give that map
and nothing else to Donald Trump

00:11:25.033 --> 00:11:27.367
and let him find his way
around Martha's Vineyard.

00:11:27.367 --> 00:11:30.167
[ Laughter ]

00:11:30.167 --> 00:11:32.834
I guarantee you he'd end up
in Nantucket Sound

00:11:32.834 --> 00:11:34.734
within half an hour,
begging a dolphin

00:11:34.734 --> 00:11:37.067
to give him a ride
to Mar-A-Lago.

00:11:37.067 --> 00:11:40.133
"Click, click, whistle,
click, whistle.

00:11:40.133 --> 00:11:43.334
Excuse me, excuse me.
Click, click.

00:11:43.334 --> 00:11:45.601
Excuse me.
Click.

00:11:45.601 --> 00:11:48.901
Click, whistle.
Whistle, click.

00:11:48.901 --> 00:11:50.767
Caravan.
I came up with that one."

00:11:50.767 --> 00:11:51.801
[ Laughter ]

00:11:51.801 --> 00:11:54.100
"Click, whistle."

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:56.767
The Republican Party
is an institution

00:11:56.767 --> 00:11:58.334
built almost entirely

00:11:58.334 --> 00:12:01.000
around spectacles
of cruelty and humiliation.

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:02.934
And that's how you know
they're desperate.

00:12:02.934 --> 00:12:05.300
They're resorting to horrific
scare tactics

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:07.868
and grotesque stunts
in an effort to gin up

00:12:07.868 --> 00:12:10.067
yet another election-year panic
about the border.

00:12:10.067 --> 00:12:11.434
And by his own admission,

00:12:11.434 --> 00:12:13.267
Trump just pulls this stuff
straight out...

00:12:13.267 --> 00:12:15.400
-My ass.
[ Laughter ]

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:17.200
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:20.767
♪♪

00:12:20.767 --> 00:12:22.467
The midterm elections
are coming up,

00:12:22.467 --> 00:12:25.400
so to make sure that you're good
to vote in this election,

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:28.234
visit our good friends
at headcount.org

00:12:28.234 --> 00:12:30.367
to check your
voter-registration status

00:12:30.367 --> 00:12:32.467
or to register to vote.

